The corpse-drag feature in this mod (CorpseDragController, CorpseWeaponLink,
CorpseRagdollSettlement, RagdollJointStability, and the chest-anchor lookup and Harmony patches
built on them) is a derivative work ported from TraumaCore's WoundInspection feature set. Files
have been modified: trimmed to the drag-only subset, decoupled from TraumaCore's own plugin
config/logging, and extended with Fika multiplayer sync (BodyDragSync, BodyDragFika).

The downed-player drag (BodyDragFika/DownedDrag.cs, DownedRagdollDrive.cs) uses techniques and
constants from KeepMeAlive (https://github.com/awnova/KeepMeAlive), licensed under the MIT License:
Copyright (c) awnova, KaiKiNoodles (original RevivalMod), thuynguyentrungdang (BringMeToLifeMod).
The trail-point follow math, the owner-side DirectApplyMotion walk, the kinematic hand tether and
the detach-from-root handling are re-implemented from its DownedDragController and BodyRagdoll.

The optional Rupture integration (SPT-BodyDragging/Integration, BodyDragFika/ManagedDrag*) was
contributed by rootdarkarchon against Rupture's corpse drag ABI V1.
